    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Current Version</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The only available weapon is currently a sword, which will be added in future updates.</u></strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Hero is a game that combines storage organization and rogue light action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By setting \u201cchips\u201d in storage, the player's stats and possible actions increase according to the effect of the \u201cchip\u201d, enhancing the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and fight against enemies, and aim to defeat the boss at the lowest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Chips </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing \u201cchips\u201d in storage changes the character's status and increases the number of actions possible. The effect can also be enhanced by enlarging the \u201cchip\u201d itself. There are several types of chips, including actions (attack, evade), status (HP, speed, attack power), and items that can be used up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.poster.avif?t=1744081946\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.webm?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.mp4?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.poster.avif?t=1744081946\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.webm?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.mp4?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Hero is a game that combines storage organization and rogue light action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By setting \u201cchips\u201d in storage, the player's stats and possible actions increase according to the effect of the \u201cchip\u201d, enhancing the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and fight against enemies, and aim to defeat the boss at the lowest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Chips </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing \u201cchips\u201d in storage changes the character's status and increases the number of actions possible. The effect can also be enhanced by enlarging the \u201cchip\u201d itself. There are several types of chips, including actions (attack, evade), status (HP, speed, attack power), and items that can be used up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.poster.avif?t=1744081946\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.webm?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/b617465269d44f46d1b12ac6195e3a4b.mp4?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.poster.avif?t=1744081946\" width=622 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.webm?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189100/extras/404465c5f12f158b07e4235c01ce410f.mp4?t=1744081946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
